 " asks for a constant distance both ways. The line runs on past the ends of \
its parallel, and its last vertices are farther from it, so the test rejects \
the pair:"
}], "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"3b447cab-d138-4b3f-b632-3c22acc635d4"],

